1
00:01:08,580 --> 00:01:12,950
[Faces Reborn]

2
00:01:13,010 --> 00:01:16,060
[Episode 2]

3
00:01:24,640 --> 00:01:25,590
Thank you, everyone.

4
00:01:25,590 --> 00:01:27,300
-Happy birthday!
-Happy birthday!

5
00:01:27,300 --> 00:01:30,110
I want to start
by thanking our producer, Gang.

6
00:01:30,920 --> 00:01:33,150
Thank you for throwing
this birthday party for me.

7
00:01:33,150 --> 00:01:34,979
And thank you all for coming.

8
00:01:35,229 --> 00:01:37,350
I hope you all have a great time today.

9
00:01:37,430 --> 00:01:37,950
Cheers.

10
00:01:37,950 --> 00:01:39,039
Cheers!

11
00:01:39,039 --> 00:01:40,180
Happy birthday!

12
00:01:40,180 --> 00:01:41,180
Happy birthday!

13
00:01:41,229 --> 00:01:42,560
Please make yourselves at home.

14
00:01:42,560 --> 00:01:44,509
Babe, you look gorgeous today.

15
00:01:45,509 --> 00:01:46,450
Thank you.

16
00:01:46,710 --> 00:01:47,509
Thank you.

17
00:01:47,509 --> 00:01:48,870
-Happy birthday.
-You too.

18
00:01:48,870 --> 00:01:49,479
Thank you.

19
00:01:49,479 --> 00:01:49,950
Cheers.

20
00:02:14,650 --> 00:02:15,240
Excuse me.

21
00:02:15,240 --> 00:02:16,230
Okay, bye.

22
00:02:26,800 --> 00:02:29,310
Why are you, the birthday girl,
here all alone?

23
00:02:29,310 --> 00:02:30,510
Not going up to dance?

24
00:02:31,630 --> 00:02:32,530
I'm observing.

25
00:02:33,630 --> 00:02:34,560
Observing what?

26
00:02:40,380 --> 00:02:42,570
I'm observing who's worth my time.

27
00:03:22,470 --> 00:03:23,840
It's my first time attending

28
00:03:23,840 --> 00:03:25,370
such an interesting party.

29
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:28,590
When I was studying abroad,

30
00:03:28,750 --> 00:03:30,130
my teacher told me

31
00:03:30,240 --> 00:03:33,360
a party is a more vivid drama
than a classroom.

32
00:03:33,640 --> 00:03:35,120
Every conversation,

33
00:03:36,030 --> 00:03:37,100
every toast.

34
00:03:43,710 --> 00:03:45,520
Director Xu, since you majored in drama,

35
00:03:45,520 --> 00:03:47,460
which classic play

36
00:03:47,700 --> 00:03:49,980
is the inspiration for your next work?

37
00:03:52,360 --> 00:03:55,280
Perhaps, Mr. Zhao, you know "Medea".

38
00:03:56,900 --> 00:03:58,500
The woman driven mad by love,

39
00:04:00,470 --> 00:04:02,670
who chooses to avenge love.

40
00:04:04,310 --> 00:04:05,510
A goddess of revenge.

41
00:04:06,310 --> 00:04:08,360
Not really my favorite kind of story.

42
00:04:08,360 --> 00:04:10,310
Then I'd guess you like

43
00:04:10,360 --> 00:04:11,640
Shakespeare.

44
00:04:12,750 --> 00:04:16,220
After all, your gentlemanly manner
is very British.

45
00:04:25,340 --> 00:04:26,260
Director Xu,

46
00:04:26,610 --> 00:04:28,240
are you sure we haven't

47
00:04:28,600 --> 00:04:29,430
met before?

48
00:04:31,070 --> 00:04:32,200
I always feel

49
00:04:32,360 --> 00:04:34,760
like we've known each other
for a long time.

50
00:04:35,120 --> 00:04:36,040
Really?

51
00:04:40,990 --> 00:04:42,320
I've heard people say

52
00:04:42,350 --> 00:04:44,630
when you feel someone is familiar,

53
00:04:44,650 --> 00:04:48,170
it means you have
unfinished business with them.

54
00:04:48,270 --> 00:04:50,940
So what do you think we are to each other?

55
00:04:53,600 --> 00:04:54,920
I'd say lovers.

56
00:04:55,120 --> 00:04:56,190
Or maybe

57
00:04:56,360 --> 00:04:57,370
enemies.

58
00:05:51,770 --> 00:05:53,370
[The First Affiliated Hospital
of Yingcheng Medical University]

59
00:05:53,390 --> 00:05:55,650
[Skin Matching Test Report
for Full-Face Skin Grafting]

60
00:06:01,160 --> 00:06:02,490
They dance really well.

61
00:06:03,680 --> 00:06:04,680
Come on, join me.

62
00:06:04,700 --> 00:06:05,390
Come.

63
00:06:08,480 --> 00:06:10,530
Director Xu, what's wrong?

64
00:06:12,390 --> 00:06:14,510
Mr. Zhao, I think you have

65
00:06:15,120 --> 00:06:16,680
a special scent.

66
00:06:17,300 --> 00:06:18,390
What scent?

67
00:06:20,280 --> 00:06:21,560
Aromatherapy.

68
00:06:21,920 --> 00:06:24,970
Maybe the scent from home
got on my clothes.

69
00:06:26,010 --> 00:06:27,680
Did you pick it yourself?

70
00:06:30,190 --> 00:06:31,000
I'm used to it.

71
00:06:35,040 --> 00:06:37,170
Director Xu, you're leaving so early?

72
00:06:41,590 --> 00:06:43,100
I have to work tomorrow.

73
00:07:04,790 --> 00:07:07,750
[Stars Gather
at Xu Jing's Birthday Banquet]

74
00:07:09,310 --> 00:07:10,120
Jia'an!

75
00:07:12,430 --> 00:07:13,040
Madam.

76
00:07:14,020 --> 00:07:15,780
Look into this woman for me.

77
00:07:14,040 --> 00:07:15,590
[Stars Gather
at Xu Jing's Birthday Banquet]

78
00:07:16,040 --> 00:07:16,770
Understood.

79
00:07:20,480 --> 00:07:21,390
[Stars Gather
at Xu Jing's Birthday Banquet]

80
00:07:22,950 --> 00:07:24,000
Interesting.

81
00:07:25,270 --> 00:07:26,750
Dear, I'm home.

82
00:07:27,310 --> 00:07:28,510
I'm going upstairs to shower.

83
00:07:28,510 --> 00:07:29,270
Dear.

84
00:07:32,470 --> 00:07:33,159
Come sit.

85
00:07:40,680 --> 00:07:41,530
What's wrong?

86
00:07:42,600 --> 00:07:44,000
How was the birthday party?

87
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:45,070
Did you have fun?

88
00:07:46,070 --> 00:07:47,090
It was pretty fun.

89
00:07:49,720 --> 00:07:51,430
I just saw some photos.

90
00:07:52,870 --> 00:07:53,870
They looked good.

91
00:07:55,830 --> 00:07:57,140
It's for work.

92
00:07:57,920 --> 00:07:58,850
Zhao Xiao,

93
00:07:59,400 --> 00:08:00,920
since when did you start

94
00:08:01,040 --> 00:08:02,630
working so hard?

95
00:08:05,710 --> 00:08:06,490
Dear.

96
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:08,920
Dear.

97
00:08:10,000 --> 00:08:11,400
You're overthinking it.

98
00:08:11,700 --> 00:08:13,160
I've been in investing for so long.

99
00:08:13,160 --> 00:08:15,470
I've seen everything
in the entertainment industry.

100
00:08:15,470 --> 00:08:16,260
Di'er.

101
00:08:17,120 --> 00:08:18,850
She's the director of our show.

102
00:08:18,920 --> 00:08:20,000
I was just talking to her
about the character.

103
00:08:20,000 --> 00:08:22,280
I pushed you from a bit actor

104
00:08:22,480 --> 00:08:24,660
step by step to where you are today,

105
00:08:24,830 --> 00:08:27,800
and now you're telling me it's just work?

106
00:08:32,809 --> 00:08:35,000
I know exactly what I should

107
00:08:35,030 --> 00:08:36,409
and shouldn't do.

108
00:08:37,120 --> 00:08:38,120
I'm doing all this

109
00:08:38,120 --> 00:08:39,980
just to keep myself from falling.

110
00:08:40,440 --> 00:08:41,700
You should support me.

111
00:08:42,320 --> 00:08:44,380
How else do you want me to support you?

112
00:08:45,910 --> 00:08:47,200
By being your ATM?

113
00:08:47,720 --> 00:08:50,250
Or do you think
I'll always be such a pushover?

114
00:08:56,030 --> 00:08:57,980
I'm talking to you.

115
00:08:58,080 --> 00:08:59,540
Can you change this scent?

116
00:09:00,510 --> 00:09:01,600
We've been married for so long,

117
00:09:01,600 --> 00:09:03,330
and now you think it smells bad?

118
00:09:04,780 --> 00:09:05,540
Jia'an!

119
00:09:05,960 --> 00:09:06,750
Go to the store tomorrow

120
00:09:06,750 --> 00:09:09,810
and buy up all the aromatherapy
products in this scent!

121
00:09:15,390 --> 00:09:16,520
Where are you going?

122
00:09:17,440 --> 00:09:19,040
I'm going to check on the kid.

123
00:09:20,080 --> 00:09:20,630
Mom.

124
00:09:21,200 --> 00:09:22,420
Xiao, you're back.

125
00:09:22,730 --> 00:09:24,010
Qiao just fell asleep.

126
00:09:24,510 --> 00:09:26,040
You've been working all day.

127
00:09:26,040 --> 00:09:27,440
Hurry upstairs and rest.

128
00:09:27,630 --> 00:09:29,770
So you know he's been working all day.

129
00:09:29,840 --> 00:09:31,000
As his agent,

130
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:33,150
you didn't go with him
to such an important event,

131
00:09:33,150 --> 00:09:35,880
and that's how someone else
took advantage of it.

132
00:09:37,240 --> 00:09:38,030
Di'er.

133
00:09:42,960 --> 00:09:44,120
Di'er.

134
00:09:44,440 --> 00:09:45,580
Don't be mad.

135
00:09:45,840 --> 00:09:47,760
How could Zhao Xiao do that?

136
00:09:47,870 --> 00:09:50,580
That woman is Director Xu Jing.

137
00:09:50,720 --> 00:09:53,080
It's just a normal working relationship.

138
00:09:53,480 --> 00:09:54,320
Director?

139
00:09:55,140 --> 00:09:56,500
Just a rookie director.

140
00:09:56,910 --> 00:09:59,630
Since when does Zhao Xiao need
to latch onto someone like that?

141
00:09:59,630 --> 00:10:01,360
I heard her next project

142
00:10:01,360 --> 00:10:02,550
is a big production.

143
00:10:02,790 --> 00:10:05,600
I just thought Zhao Xiao
should get along well with her,

144
00:10:05,600 --> 00:10:07,790
-so in the future...
-Without my money,

145
00:10:07,790 --> 00:10:09,590
he wouldn't even have this role.

146
00:10:10,390 --> 00:10:11,850
My mom isn't feeling well.

147
00:10:12,120 --> 00:10:13,180
Let her rest first.

148
00:10:13,860 --> 00:10:15,460
I'll handle the photo thing.

149
00:10:15,550 --> 00:10:16,320
Good.

150
00:10:17,630 --> 00:10:19,230
You'd better handle it well.

151
00:10:52,390 --> 00:10:53,200
Xiao.

152
00:10:53,200 --> 00:10:54,240
You're up.

153
00:10:54,240 --> 00:10:55,440
Go wake Di'er up.

154
00:10:55,440 --> 00:10:57,050
Tell her breakfast is ready,

155
00:10:57,120 --> 00:10:58,850
and apologize to her properly.

156
00:11:00,910 --> 00:11:02,030
Xiao.

157
00:11:02,720 --> 00:11:04,450
She spent so much money on you—

158
00:11:04,510 --> 00:11:05,870
acting out is just her way

159
00:11:05,870 --> 00:11:08,130
of getting you to sweet-talk her, right?

160
00:11:10,320 --> 00:11:11,320
And give her this.

161
00:11:25,080 --> 00:11:27,600
Don't think you can
appease me with a diamond ring.

162
00:11:27,600 --> 00:11:29,920
Yesterday's news is still trending.

163
00:11:31,320 --> 00:11:32,790
Dear,

164
00:11:40,320 --> 00:11:42,270
I'll post on Weibo,

165
00:11:42,470 --> 00:11:44,320
and the paparazzi will shut up, right?

166
00:11:42,870 --> 00:11:44,230
[A Hearty Breakfast]

167
00:11:47,110 --> 00:11:48,550
[A Hearty Breakfast]

168
00:11:50,480 --> 00:11:51,390
Let's eat.

169
00:11:55,720 --> 00:11:56,480
Di'er.

170
00:11:58,000 --> 00:12:00,150
Do you like the ring he gave you?

171
00:12:02,320 --> 00:12:04,580
Zhao Xiao had a friend buy it

172
00:12:04,600 --> 00:12:07,810
specially from abroad a while ago.

173
00:12:09,120 --> 00:12:10,270
It's not bad.

174
00:12:11,870 --> 00:12:12,840
Mom!

175
00:12:13,150 --> 00:12:14,240
I'm here.

176
00:12:16,720 --> 00:12:18,600
Here comes the debt collector again.

177
00:12:18,600 --> 00:12:19,750
Good morning, sister-in-law.

178
00:12:19,750 --> 00:12:20,360
Morning.

179
00:12:21,320 --> 00:12:22,580
Why are you here again?

180
00:12:23,120 --> 00:12:24,440
Didn't I tell you

181
00:12:24,510 --> 00:12:26,240
to call me if you need anything?

182
00:12:26,310 --> 00:12:27,660
Why? Can't I come?

183
00:12:32,790 --> 00:12:34,150
I was just passing by.

184
00:12:34,480 --> 00:12:37,150
I waited on those big shots
all night last night,

185
00:12:37,320 --> 00:12:38,710
so I'm a little hungry

186
00:12:38,790 --> 00:12:40,160
and wanted a bite.

187
00:12:47,010 --> 00:12:48,470
Thanks for your hard work.

188
00:12:53,630 --> 00:12:55,430
Hurry up and thank your brother.

189
00:12:56,000 --> 00:12:57,330
Is there anything else?

190
00:12:57,510 --> 00:12:59,240
Here's a birthday gift for you.

191
00:13:05,510 --> 00:13:06,230
Thanks.

192
00:13:06,440 --> 00:13:07,720
I've got something to do. I'm off.

193
00:13:07,720 --> 00:13:08,720
Bye, sis-in-law.

194
00:13:23,350 --> 00:13:26,160
[Zhao Xiao]

195
00:13:39,910 --> 00:13:40,840
Hello, Mr. Zhao?

196
00:13:40,910 --> 00:13:41,790
Director Xu.

197
00:13:42,480 --> 00:13:43,870
Hope I'm not disturbing you.

198
00:13:43,870 --> 00:13:44,440
No.

199
00:13:44,440 --> 00:13:45,770
I'm reading the script.

200
00:13:45,840 --> 00:13:46,650
What's up?

201
00:13:47,390 --> 00:13:49,390
About yesterday's birthday party,

202
00:13:49,510 --> 00:13:51,440
I wonder if you're feeling better.

203
00:13:52,480 --> 00:13:53,120
By the way,

204
00:13:54,790 --> 00:13:55,510
I always feel

205
00:13:55,510 --> 00:13:58,120
our communication isn't deep enough.

206
00:13:58,240 --> 00:13:59,200
Really?

207
00:13:59,360 --> 00:14:00,960
I think we've already said
everything we needed to.

208
00:14:00,960 --> 00:14:02,180
It's about the role.

209
00:14:02,870 --> 00:14:03,860
I feel like

210
00:14:04,240 --> 00:14:06,120
I still have a lot of ideas
to share with you.

211
00:14:06,120 --> 00:14:07,180
We'll have dedicated time

212
00:14:07,180 --> 00:14:09,000
to discuss the role
before shooting starts.

213
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:10,200
But I just feel

214
00:14:10,670 --> 00:14:12,910
we should build
some mutual understanding first

215
00:14:12,910 --> 00:14:14,030
as partners.

216
00:14:21,120 --> 00:14:22,510
What kind of understanding do you want?

217
00:14:22,510 --> 00:14:25,440
Actors and directors
need to understand each other.

218
00:14:26,080 --> 00:14:28,270
I want to know what you're thinking too.

219
00:14:28,270 --> 00:14:29,510
We'll have plenty of time

220
00:14:29,510 --> 00:14:31,510
to talk during the collaboration.

221
00:14:31,790 --> 00:14:32,430
Of course.

222
00:14:33,030 --> 00:14:33,840
But...

223
00:14:35,840 --> 00:14:37,500
Do you have any plans tonight?

224
00:14:39,030 --> 00:14:40,480
Sorry, Mr. Zhao.

225
00:14:41,000 --> 00:14:43,330
I have an audition scheduled for tonight.

226
00:14:44,030 --> 00:14:45,490
Are you coming to that too?

227
00:14:46,320 --> 00:14:47,390
That's perfect.

228
00:14:48,120 --> 00:14:49,510
I can give you some advice

229
00:14:49,510 --> 00:14:51,170
from an actor's perspective.

230
00:14:52,720 --> 00:14:54,080
That's not really appropriate, is it?

231
00:14:54,080 --> 00:14:56,740
Aren't we both just
trying to make the show good?

232
00:14:56,870 --> 00:14:57,830
Where are you?

233
00:14:57,870 --> 00:15:00,030
Mr. Zhao, really, don't bother.

234
00:15:00,030 --> 00:15:00,890
It's no bother.

235
00:15:01,390 --> 00:15:02,030
I insist.

236
00:15:02,640 --> 00:15:04,170
Just send me your location.

237
00:15:05,320 --> 00:15:05,870
Okay.

238
00:15:06,510 --> 00:15:08,630
I'll send you the address
at eight tonight.

239
00:15:08,630 --> 00:15:10,510
Great. See you tonight.

240
00:15:31,180 --> 00:15:33,360
He's even more eager than I expected.
